  "description": "Generic, elastic, self-healing in-process object pool for .NET 8/9/10. Composite-signal grow under pressure, hysteretic shrink, 5-stage lifecycle hooks (Factory/BeforeUse/Check/AfterUse/Release), pluggable failure policy, built-in OpenTelemetry (Meter + ActivitySource). Async-first, DI-first.",
